# Component Composition (shadcn/ui)

Every interactive element must be a shadcn or shared component — no raw `<button>`, `<input>`, `<select>`.

| Need              | Use                                              |
|-------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| Page shell        | Card, Separator, PageHeader (shared)             |
| Data list         | DataTable + Table + Pagination                   |
| Create / Edit     | Dialog or Sheet + Form + field components        |
| Delete confirm    | AlertDialog                                      |
| Filters           | Select, Combobox, Popover, DatePicker            |
| Status            | Badge, Alert                                     |
| Loading           | Skeleton                                         |
| Empty             | EmptyState (shared) or Card with muted text      |
| Notifications     | sonner toast                                     |
| Navigation        | Sidebar, Tabs, Breadcrumb                          |
| User menu         | DropdownMenu + Avatar                            |
| Settings sections | Tabs + Form + Switch / Checkbox                  |

**Rules:**
- Add shadcn components via CLI: `npx shadcn@latest add {name}` — leave `components/ui/` unmodified.
- Custom styling via Tailwind classes and `cn()` — never edit shadcn source files.
- Extract repeated patterns into shared components (`ConfirmDialog`, `PageHeader`, `DataTable`).
- Pages are assembled from Cards, Tables, Dialogs, and Forms — not one giant JSX block.
